# Normalize to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# The conformance suite in spec/test-vectors/ claims byte-for-byte
# reproducibility (§18.3). vectors.json is written by JSON.stringify, which
# emits LF only. Without this file, core.autocrlf=true would rewrite it to CRLF
# on checkout, and the next run of `npm run vectors` would report a diff against
# a file that had not actually changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
